1
00:00:01,400 --> 00:00:02,733
Vanakkam, Master!

2
00:00:02,983 --> 00:00:04,112
Let's learn the app!

3
00:00:06,782 --> 00:00:07,778
Open the app.

4
00:00:08,028 --> 00:00:08,895
Tap Staff.

5
00:00:09,505 --> 00:00:10,913
Tap Sign in with Google.

6
00:00:13,283 --> 00:00:14,396
This is your home.

7
00:00:15,006 --> 00:00:16,367
See today's classes.

8
00:00:16,977 --> 00:00:18,356
See payments to check.

9
00:00:18,966 --> 00:00:20,391
See reminders to send.

10
00:00:23,061 --> 00:00:24,049
Tap Attendance.

11
00:00:24,659 --> 00:00:25,900
Pick today's class.

12
00:00:27,790 --> 00:00:29,034
Here are your students.

13
00:00:29,644 --> 00:00:31,153
One tap for each child.

14
00:00:33,163 --> 00:00:34,161
Everyone came?

15
00:00:34,411 --> 00:00:35,803
Tap Mark all present.

16
00:00:37,013 --> 00:00:37,938
So fast!

17
00:00:39,588 --> 00:00:40,688
Someone absent?

18
00:00:40,938 --> 00:00:41,909
Tap Absent.

19
00:00:42,639 --> 00:00:44,046
Type why, like Fever.

20
00:00:46,056 --> 00:00:46,981
Tap Submit.

21
00:00:47,711 --> 00:00:48,291
Done!

22
00:00:49,021 --> 00:00:50,598
The parent gets a message.

23
00:00:53,628 --> 00:00:55,336
Parents send fee receipts here.

24
00:00:56,426 --> 00:00:57,575
Tap View receipt.

25
00:00:58,905 --> 00:01:00,867
Money came? Tap Acknowledge.

26
00:01:02,197 --> 00:01:03,816
Wrong? Tap Reject.

27
00:01:07,205 --> 00:01:09,138
Reminders are ready messages.

28
00:01:09,868 --> 00:01:10,690
Tap Send.

29
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:12,848
WhatsApp opens.

30
00:01:13,458 --> 00:01:14,307
Press send!

31
00:01:17,697 --> 00:01:19,370
Tap More for extra tools.

32
00:01:21,740 --> 00:01:22,924
Belt test coming?

33
00:01:23,414 --> 00:01:24,492
Tick the students.

34
00:01:25,702 --> 00:01:26,756
Tap Nominate.

35
00:01:28,766 --> 00:01:30,788
Belts shows what each belt must learn.

36
00:01:33,638 --> 00:01:35,189
Want to tell parents news?

37
00:01:35,679 --> 00:01:36,640
Write a notice.

38
00:01:38,090 --> 00:01:38,974
Tap Post.

39
00:01:40,984 --> 00:01:43,130
In Profile, see all your classes.

40
00:01:43,980 --> 00:01:46,086
Type your bank name and account number.

41
00:01:47,296 --> 00:01:48,152
Tap Save.

42
00:01:49,242 --> 00:01:50,869
Parents will see it when they pay!

43
00:01:52,879 --> 00:01:54,248
Great job, Master!

44
00:01:54,498 --> 00:01:55,991
Your students are lucky.

45
00:01:56,241 --> 00:01:57,067
Vanakkam!
